abstract: "Exact conditional tests of a declared sovereign-debt comparability screen, payment-dominance diagnostics, implementable payout bounds under partial information, and reproducible constructed examples. A nonproportional oblique-trigger family has a closed-form binding switch and sharp implementable cap."
